[2026-03-14T20:39:49.803Z] {"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01M7Av3N1oYACsjYmsMJ1swx","type":"tool_result","content":"497:- **Expected:** The app calls `POST /api/bookings` with the property_id, check_in, check_out, num_guests, and total_price. A success message is displayed (e.g., \"Booking confirmed!\") and the user is redirected to the My Trips page (`/trips`), or a confirmation is shown on the same page.\n600:## Page: My Trips (`/trips`)\n606:#### Test: My Trips page requires login\n609:- **Expected:** The user is redirected to the login page (`/login`). The My Trips page content is not displayed.\n611:#### Test: My Trips page defaults to Upcoming tab","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_016RFMzkXJXhH86YarAxXHSV","session_id":"9df30465-1e79-47a8-ad98-46e424cd0dfc","uuid":"6e2f5d9a-56c1-4134-87e6-8dc542e30499"}
